  "goodToKnow": "Betreffend means concerned, relevant or in question: die betreffende Person, das betreffende Formular. As a preposition, it means concerning: Ihre Anfrage betreffend (regarding your enquiry), very formal. It comes from betreffen (to concern, affect): Das betrifft uns alle. In emails, der Betreff is the subject line. Was mich betrifft means as far as I'm concerned. Betroffen means affected or dismayed."
